# casefeature-non-boolean — case-feature eligibility boundary fixture.
library "Case Feature Non Boolean".

// "Coded Determination" is a LocalSource concept (`code is`, lowered to a local
// CodeSystem) but its value type is CodeableConcept, NOT boolean. It is driven
// onto the decision surface, so the case-feature emit reaches it — but only a
// boolean local-source determination can become a submittable case-feature
// Observation profile. The emit must surface `emit-casefeature-non-boolean` and
// sink success (no StructureDefinition emitted).

concept "Coded Determination":
- type is Observation.
- value type is CodeableConcept.
- code is `coded-det`.

activity "Refer":
- request CPGServiceRequest.

decision "Coded Decision":
- when "Coded Determination" then recommend activity "Refer".
